{"title":"The Jersey Closet","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"The Jersey Closet"},"headingText":"Oilers Jerseys","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n### Evan Bouchard\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Bouchard_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Bourchard_Back.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **You know what goes harder than an Evan Bouchard 2024 SCF jersey? A matching Mattias Ekholm Jersey that my mom owns!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Darnell Nurse\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Nurse_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Nurse_Back.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **The first hockey jersey I ever owned, Darnell \"The Doc\" Nurse (My familly are Doctors)...**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Battle of Alberta\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\McDavid Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **While I missed the BOA in 2023 due to an MIE303 lab, I convinced my mom to get me a jersey since I could at least say the jersey had been.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### The Oil Cog\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Cog_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Nothing screams retro like the jersey that symbolizes an oilers team that was around before I was born!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Orange Crush\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Orange_Crush_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **I personally prefer grape crush, but as far as Oilers jersey's go, the orange crush is a classic.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n## Other Jerseys\n\n### Team Canada\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Canada_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **A gift from a friend for completing my engineering CO-OP! Golden Goal of friendship anyone?**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Linkoping HC\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\LHC_front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **A jersey from my journey to Sweden for LINHAC 2023 (we most definitely did not win, but still had lots of fun).**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Beleaf!\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Leafs_front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Somewhere out there there's a video of me celebrating the Morgan Rielly OT winner in game 3 of the 2023 playoffs. Somewhere.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### A Red Sox Jersey, Never Worn\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Youkilis_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=images\\Youkilis_Back.jpeg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Boooo! Booooooooo! I know I know. But this jersey was a gift from my dad when I was young, because I thought the fans we're booing him when he was up to bat, when in reality they we're yelling \"Yooooouk\"!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n## Oilers Jerseys\n### Evan Bouchard\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Bouchard_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Bourchard_Back.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **You know what goes harder than an Evan Bouchard 2024 SCF jersey? A matching Mattias Ekholm Jersey that my mom owns!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Darnell Nurse\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Nurse_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Nurse_Back.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **The first hockey jersey I ever owned, Darnell \"The Doc\" Nurse (My familly are Doctors)...**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Battle of Alberta\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\McDavid Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **While I missed the BOA in 2023 due to an MIE303 lab, I convinced my mom to get me a jersey since I could at least say the jersey had been.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### The Oil Cog\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Cog_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Nothing screams retro like the jersey that symbolizes an oilers team that was around before I was born!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Orange Crush\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Orange_Crush_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **I personally prefer grape crush, but as far as Oilers jersey's go, the orange crush is a classic.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n## Other Jerseys\n\n### Team Canada\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Canada_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **A gift from a friend for completing my engineering CO-OP! Golden Goal of friendship anyone?**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Linkoping HC\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\LHC_front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **A jersey from my journey to Sweden for LINHAC 2023 (we most definitely did not win, but still had lots of fun).**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### Beleaf!\n::: {.row .reverse}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Leafs_front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Somewhere out there there's a video of me celebrating the Morgan Rielly OT winner in game 3 of the 2023 playoffs. Somewhere.**\n</div>\n:::\n\n### A Red Sox Jersey, Never Worn\n::: {.row}\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=\"images\\Youkilis_Front.jpeg\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"image\">\n  <img src=images\\Youkilis_Back.jpeg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n  **Boooo! Booooooooo! I know I know. But this jersey was a gift from my dad when I was young, because I thought the fans we're booing him when he was up to bat, when in reality they we're yelling \"Yooooouk\"!**\n</div>\n:::\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,